          "date": "2026-10-30 04:01:00.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20879 target: consolidate OUT_UPDATE handling",
        "message": "LU-20879 target: consolidate OUT_UPDATE handling\n\nFetch OUT_UPDATE buffers in out_handle() with tgt_update_bufs_get(),\nthe helper shared with mdt_batch(), instead of its own copy of the\ninline/bulk buffer setup, and check each update buffer with the new\nout_update_request_check() helper.\n\nCheck opcode in out_handler_find().  Check the object mode with\ndt_mode_is_valid() before deriving object format.\n\nReturn -EINVAL from dt_record_write() when object is not writable.\n\nSwabbing is now done in out_update_request_check(), so RMF_OUT_UPDATE,\nlustre_swab_object_update(), and lustre_swab_object_update_request()\nare now unused and are removed.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: dcaf8a6724ef (\"LU-6741 osp: Pack small request inline\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-4.8 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I2cdb6c2ca8525bd62e9c1a41fafa6969d23ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
